-- Inert: no rule decides it.

§ `7. The end of one insured's cover`

-- 7.1 (an employee), 7.2 (a member of a sponsoring organisation) and 7.3 (a dependant) each
-- end cover automatically on the EARLIEST of a list of days. Fork F29: cover is lost from the
-- start of that day; for (h), the end of the period, the definitions of the period and of the
-- insurance year keep the whole last day covered (src 88-92, 98-102), so it is not in the list
-- below and the period's last day is tested separately.
