-- (e): leaving Vietnam for over 180 consecutive days "without notifying the Company in advance
-- and/or without the Company's agreement to continue cover". Fork F27: either the notice or
-- the agreement keeps cover. The day named is the day the insured LEFT, so cover is lost
-- from the departure, once the absence passes 180 days (NOTES.md, Findings).
GIVETH A NUMBER
`general provision 7: the most consecutive days outside Vietnam without notice` MEANS 180

GIVEN a IS AN `An absence from Vietnam`
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`general provision 7(e): the day cover ends for the absence` a MEANS
    IF       a's `consecutive days outside Vietnam` GREATER THAN `general provision 7: the most consecutive days outside Vietnam without notice`
         AND NOT a's `notified the Company beforehand`
         AND NOT a's `the Company agreed to continue cover`
    THEN JUST (a's `date of leaving Vietnam`)
    ELSE NOTHING

-- (f) (7.3(h) for a dependant): the day the insured does not notify the Company AT ONCE
-- ("ngay") of a change in the facts the premium rests on that increases the risk, including
-- any illness or Injury arising in the period. Fork F28: the Injury being claimed is notified
-- under general provision 13(a), so it is not one of these changes; read literally it would
-- be, and cover would end on the day of the accident (NOTES.md, Findings).
GIVEN c IS A `A change increasing the risk`
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`general provision 7(f): the day cover ends for the change` c MEANS
    IF c's `notified to the Company immediately`
    THEN NOTHING
    ELSE JUST (c's `date of the change`)

GIVEN p IS AN `An insured person`
      f IS A `The insured's cover facts`
GIVETH A LIST OF DATE
`general provision 7: the days on which the insured's cover may end` p `,` f MEANS
    foldr append EMPTY (LIST
        `the date, if there is one` (f's `date the insured ceased to be eligible, for a reason other than age`)
      , `the date, if there is one` (f's `date the group contract ended`)
      , `the date for the insured's place in the group`
      , `the day after the payment period, if the premium was not paid`
      , concat (map (GIVEN a YIELD `the date, if there is one` (`general provision 7(e): the day cover ends for the absence` a)) (f's `absences from Vietnam`))
      , concat (map (GIVEN c YIELD `the date, if there is one` (`general provision 7(f): the day cover ends for the change` c)) (f's `changes increasing the risk`))
      , `the date, if there is one` (f's `date the benefits were used up`))
    WHERE
        `the date, if there is one` md MEANS
            CONSIDER md
            WHEN NOTHING THEN EMPTY
            WHEN JUST d  THEN LIST d
        `the day after the payment period, if the premium was not paid` MEANS
            IF f's `premium for the insured paid in full within the payment period`
            THEN EMPTY
            ELSE LIST (f's `last day of the payment period` PLUS 1)
        `the date for the insured's place in the group` MEANS
            CONSIDER p's `place in the group`
            WHEN `an employee of the employer`             THEN `the date, if there is one` (f's `date employment with the employer ended`)
            WHEN `a member of the sponsoring organisation` THEN `the date, if there is one` (f's `date membership of the sponsoring organisation ended`)
            WHEN `a dependant` r                           THEN `the date, if there is one` (f's `date the insured member's own cover ended`)

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      p IS AN `An insured person`
      s IS A `The policy schedule`
      f IS A `The insured's cover facts`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the insured's cover was in force on` d `, for` p `under` s `and` f MEANS
        d AT LEAST `the first day of cover for` p `under` s `and` f
    AND d AT MOST  s's `last day of the period of insurance`
    AND all (GIVEN e YIELD d LESS THAN e) (`general provision 7: the days on which the insured's cover may end` p `,` f)

-- The refunds. In cases (a), (c) and (e) of 7.1, (a), (b) and (e) of 7.2, and (a), (c) and
-- (e) of 7.3, the policyholder receives the premium paid for that insured less the premium for
-- the time cover was in force at the short-period rates of general provision 9, provided no
-- claim has been made for that insured and no breach of the contract exists then.
