GIVEN `the premium paid`                IS A NUMBER
      `the tax on the sum kept`         IS A NUMBER
      `the damages the policyholder owes` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`general provision 8.3(b): the refund on cancellation for the policyholder's misinformation, premium` `the premium paid` `, tax` `the tax on the sum kept` `, damages` `the damages the policyholder owes` MEANS
    max 0 (`the premium paid`
