        (`the risk increased` AND `the policyholder refused the Company's terms`)
    OR  `the premium was not paid in full on time`

§§ `8B. Refunds on termination`

-- On any termination with a refund of premium (pro rata to the time left or as the Company
-- otherwise decides), the Company keeps 1.500.000 đồng plus any tax for each contract. Bank
-- charges for a domestic transfer are the Company's; for a foreign account or another method,
-- the policyholder's. Whatever else the contract says, the Company may refuse a refund for an
-- insured for whom it has paid any claim.
-- How the refund is computed is "tùy theo quyết định của Công ty" (at the Company's decision):
-- no criteria (NOTES.md, Findings). Fork F37: the sum kept applies to the end of the contract,
-- not to the per-insured refunds of general provision 7.
